        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "Ah... the infamous agent 47. I believe you&apos;re considered a master among masters in your craft.\r\rI have an importan contract for you, one that requires discretions, precision and speed... That&apos;s why I need to test you. There&apos;s no second chances on the real deal. Our main target will never be exposed after our one chance you see.\r\rThe test is simple. Eliminate these man following the set conditions. I hope you can think on your feet agent 47.\r\r-  |&lt;",
